# Gameplay Luau

- Entry notes: `Feed-a-Pet-Vault/02 - Engineering/Architecture and Module Map.md` and the one system note from `Feed-a-Pet-Vault/00 - Home/Task Router.md`.
- Put new rules in pure `src/shared` calculators first and cover them in `tests/unit/Cases`. Services in `src/server` apply results to live state.
- Validate every client request on the server (existing remotes only; adding a RemoteEvent needs approval).
- Do not change `MovementConfig`, `GuardianConfig`, `EconomyConfig`, trainer prices, or resource weights outside a balance task.
- Studio uses the `StudioMemory` backend. Never open the production DataStore in Studio.
- Opt-in Play scripts under `tests/` stay opt-in.
- Run the matching unit filter and quote the pass count you saw, or say it was not run. Details: `Feed-a-Pet-Vault/02 - Engineering/Security, Testing and Diagnostics.md`.
